     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">In the code below, for the mtcars dataset, if you click a point only the cars that have the same number of gears become red. As you can see, there are lines between cars of the same number of gears. What I would like to do is to make the lines red also. That is, if I select a point, the points with the same number of gear as well as the lines between them become red. Any help will be really appreciated. I have posted this in <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30986090/only-color-lines-that-are-between-selected-points-ggvis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/30986090/only-color-lines-that-are-between-selected-points-ggvis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484681819000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2NiQh4rjpmH-F8QRF74pR6\">stack overflow</a> too. </span><br><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">library</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">ggvis</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">)</span></div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nlb </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> linked_brush</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">keys </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n\r\nmtcars </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  ggvis</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(~</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpg</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">~</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">wt</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  layer_points</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fill </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> lb</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fill</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> fill.brush </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  group_by</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gear</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  layer_lines</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  lb</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  set_options</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">width </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">300</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> height </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">300</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n  layer_points</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fill </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">:=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> data </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gear </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">%in%</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> mtcars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">[</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lb</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">selected</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">(),]$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">gear</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">]))</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </span></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#3